   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "step37",
     "description": "Layer at step 37 (defaults are the step-37 dump arrays; no overrides): the PIFM two-stream layer solution (reftra_sw kmodts = 2) at the two cloudy cells of the pinned column, gpt 3 = RRTMG g-point 13 and gpt 4 = RRTMG g-point 47, k = 16, both sky members (the clear member reads the clear optics ztauc/zomcc/zgcc, the total member the total optics ztauo/zomco/zgco at the cloudy cells). Expected values are the dump columns zrefc/zrefdc/ztrac/ztradc of the clear member and zrefo/zrefdo/ztrao/ztrado of the total member at the same cells (cam_rad_spcvmc.csv): both cells take the non-conservative branch (zwo = 0.672 / 0.965 < zwcrit = 0.9999995); the conservative-branch interior (zwo >= zwcrit with ze2 < 1) and the ze2 == 1 override are not exercised by the dump (the clear cells hit the conservative branch but return the unitary values, unpinned).",
