  "CamRrtmgSwDirectBeam": {
   "expression_templates": {
    "spcvmc_zdbt": {
     "description": "Direct-beam layer transmittance of spcvmc_sw (rrtmg_sw_spcvmc.f90:555-593) with the exponential lookup table written in closed form (rrtmg_sw_init.f90:88-95): for ze1 = tau/muz <= od_lo = 0.06 the quadratic expansion 1 - ze1 + 0.5*ze1^2, else exp(-bpade*tfn/(1 - tfn)) with tfn = itc/ntbl, itc = min(floor(ntbl*ze1/(bpade + ze1) + 0.5), ntbl - 1), bpade = 1/0.278, ntbl = 10000 (the itind = 10000 boundary value is 0, exp_tbl(10000)). The closed form is the exact limit of the table as ntbl -> infinity; the instrumented build's exp_tbl is filled with tfn = float(itr)/float(ntbl) in 32-bit default REAL (rrtmg_sw_init.f90:92-94), so the dumped table values carry the single-precision rounding of tfn (up to ~4e-6 relative on the physically relevant table entries), and the DirectBeam table-branch pins run at rtol 1e-6 with that artifact documented in the tests.",
     "params": [
      "tau",
      "muz",
      "od_lo",
      "bpade",
      "ntbl"
     ],
     "body": {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "<=",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "tau",
           "muz"
          ]
         },
         "od_lo"
        ]
       },
