    {
     "id": "step47",
     "description": "DirectBeam at step 47 (the step-47 dump arrays and solar geometry override the defaults): the exponential-table branch of the spcvmc_zdbt law at gpt 2 = RRTMG g-point 9, k = 21 (ze1 = 1.1341/0.5101 = 2.2235 > od_lo, on the real dumped gas-plus-cloud optics ztauo), and the cumulative surface transmittance ptdbt(34) over the whole column (the k-21 cloud dominates; every other layer is clear). Expected values are the dump columns zdbtc/zdbt (cam_rad_spcvmc.csv, k = 21) and ztdbtc/ztdbt (cam_rad_spcvmc_ifc.csv, k_ifc 34), pinned at rtol 1e-6 (layer pins) and 1e-5 (the surface cumulants, whose ~30 table-branch layer factors accumulate the artifact) for the same documented 32-bit-real exp_tbl fill artifact as the step37 test.",
