   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "step37",
     "description": "Adding method at step 37 (full-array overrides of the six layer-optics inputs with the dump columns of cam_rad_spcvmc.csv/cam_rad_spcvmc_ifc.csv: member 1 = the clear column zrefc/zrefdc/ztrac/ztradc/zdbtc/ztdbtc, member 2 = the McICA blend of spcvmc.f90:501-508 the second vrtqdr_sw call receives, zrefo at the cloudy cells and zrefc elsewhere, with the blended layer direct-beam zdbt and its cumulative ztdbt; the surface albedo scalars default to the step-37 dump values). Expected values are the dump columns zcu/zcd of the clear member and zfu/zfd of the total member (cam_rad_spcvmc_ifc.csv): the interface fluxes of RRTMG g-point 13 (gpt 3) at the TOA and mid-column k_ifc 17 (its surface interface underflows to 0 through the diffuse transmittance of the lowest layers, ztradc(33) = 8.5e-158, so it is not pinned), the same points plus the well-conditioned surface k_ifc 34 of RRTMG g-point 47 (gpt 4), and the gathered surface albedo palbp_g/palbd_g = the dumped palbp/palbd. A wrong kb/k_ifc index mapping, boundary value or zreflect would change all of these.",
